      "w": 660,
      "h": 650,
      "text": "05 · 怎么衡量"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 564,
      "w": 1400,
      "h": 650,
      "text": "04 · 我的工作"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 860,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "03 · 产品形态"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 760,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "02 · 业务场景"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 380,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "01 · 业务问题"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "能力很强，但不好驾驭"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "多 Agent 协作已经能做复杂的开发任务，但有两个问题挡在前面。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**门槛高**\n怎么拆任务、选哪些 Agent、按什么顺序，全靠用户。AI coding 新手上不了手。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**复用差**\n老手能搭出好用的流程，但每次都要重搭。好的流程沉淀不下来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "多 Agent 协作，本质是任务拆解"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "单个 Agent 做不完，所以要拆。拆得好不好，决定了产出。"
    },
    {
      "id": "m",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 246,
      "w": 160,
      "h": 90,
      "text": "**拆解**\n压在用户身上"
    },
    {
      "id": "nw",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 210,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**新手**\n不知道怎么拆"
    },
    {
      "id": "ex",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 210,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**老手**\n拆得好，但每次都要重来"
    },
    {
      "id": "wf",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 272,
      "h": 310,
      "text": "**工作流把一种拆法固定下来**\n谁来做、按什么顺序、怎么交接。\n\n现有做法是两个极端：\n- 固定流程：可控，但不灵活\n- 开放编排：灵活，但又回到靠用户\n\n**我们的思路：** 拆解交给 Agent，用户掌握全局。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Roundtable：Agent 们的群聊"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "挑几个 Agent，设一个目标，剩下的交给团队。上面是流程，下面是三道关。"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 140,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**团队 + 目标**\n由用户挑选"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1454,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 140,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**工作流**\n由系统推荐"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 140,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**方案**\n由 Agent 们讨论"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1786,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 140,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**任务**\n由 PM Agent 拆分、分发"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1952,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 140,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**交付**\n由 Agent 们完成"
    },
    {
      "id": "ru",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 306,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**复用**\n跑通的工作流进入可视化编辑器和模板市场"
    },
    {
      "id": "g1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 140,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**第一关 · 执行前**\n用户 review 方案"
    },
    {
      "id": "g2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1786,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 140,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**第二关 · 执行中**\nPM Agent 监督并上升问题"
    },
    {
      "id": "g3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1952,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 140,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**第三关 · 交付前**\n先过测试 Agent 的测试"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 1344,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "我负责的两件事，都在拆解这一侧"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 1344,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "A：规划入口的工作流推荐。   B：把好的拆解方式沉淀下来复用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "qa",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 676,
      "w": 500,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**A · 入口的工作流推荐**"
    },
    {
      "id": "why",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**为什么是入口**\n工作流选错，后面每个节点都白做。"
    },
    {
      "id": "k1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 284,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 260,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**1 · 工作流元数据**\n任务类型、适用场景、Agent 角色、输入输出、节点、约束。"
    },
    {
      "id": "k2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 572,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 260,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**2 · 30 条评测集**\n专门放进容易混淆的 case。"
    },
    {
      "id": "k3",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**3 · Badcase 归因**\n根因：模型不了解这些工作流。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fx",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 880,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 150,
      "text": "**优化**\n- 5 个 few-shot：正反例，附推理解释\n- ICE 结构的 prompt，schema 输出防幻觉"
    },
    {
      "id": "res",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1184,
      "y": 900,
      "w": 188,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**16 → 28（共 30 条）**\n选对工作流 · Seed 2.0 Pro · +40 个百分点"
    },
    {
      "id": "qb",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 1028,
      "w": 500,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**B · 沉淀好的拆解方式**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ed",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 1064,
      "w": 260,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**可视化编辑器**\n保存跑通的工作流，并可以修改。"
    },
    {
      "id": "mk",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 316,
      "y": 1064,
      "w": 260,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**模板市场**\n直接复用别人的工作流。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ef",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 604,
      "y": 1064,
      "w": 280,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "老手不用再重搭，新手从模板起步。"
    },
    {
      "id": "top",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 1064,
      "w": 432,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**前三名** · 字节跳动 AI 全栈开发挑战赛\n我带领团队，并在决赛做了 demo 展示。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "目前先量入口"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "一个比赛周期内的项目：端到端的效果还没有系统地量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "now",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 676,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**现在**"
    },
    {
      "id": "acc",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**入口准确率**\n选对工作流，包括易混淆的 case"
    },
    {
      "id": "acc2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1738,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 354,
      "h": 150,
      "text": "**目前 28/30**\n为什么选这个指标：入口一旦选错，下游全部白做，所以它是产出质量的前提。"
    },
    {
      "id": "next",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 1028,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**如果继续做**"
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 1064,
      "w": 290,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**产出质量**\n测试 Agent 的一次通过率"
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 1802,
      "y": 1064,
      "w": 290,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**复用**\n从模板启动的任务占比"
    }
  ],
